data: {"id": "ca5fbfbb8d4c4404-thinking-parallel_evidence-3498", "run_id": "ca5fbfbb8d4c4404", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n**Pod 身份与状态**：\n- 实体：`aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4`，UID/名称唯一，`phase=Pending`\n- 被控于 ReplicaSet `workload-65b7f54794`（DESIRED=1, CURRENT=1, READY=0）\n- 调度到 node2/10.2.0.50，PVC 已绑定\n\n**ImagePullBackOff 证据链**：\n- `containerStatuses[0].reason=ImagePullBackOff`, `exitCode=None`\n- kubectl_describe 记录：kubelet 事件 `Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"`，已累积 **x328 次**，持续约 **78 分钟**\n- kubectl_events 确认同一事件，最新一条 3m11s 前\n- kubectl_logs 返回 `BadRequest: container \"ap", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788414638305, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

